1:["$","$Ld",null,{"page":{"id":"phase-7--7b-go-to-school","kind":"phase-article","route":"/roadmap/phase-7/7b-go-to-school","sourceUrl":"https://refold.la/roadmap/phase-7/7b-go-to-school","sourceHash":"df6de5701710dcc5ab8f8241c541df37b429fb5489c6655ee43230a9bea4d026","collectedAt":"2026-09-01T23:12:08.139Z","bodyMode":"authorized-full-body","title":{"en":"7B — Go to School","zh":"7B——回到学校"},"description":{"en":"","zh":""},"segments":[{"id":"what-youre-doing","type":"heading","level":2,"content":{"en":"What You're Doing","zh":"你正在做什么"}},{"id":"segment-0002","type":"paragraph","content":{"en":"Native speakers don't just learn their language — they learn <em>through</em> their language. They spend over a decade in school absorbing history, science, geography, literature, and more, all in the target language. This gives them a shared body of knowledge and a familiarity with academic language that non-native speakers typically lack.","zh":"母语者不只是学习自己的语言——他们还<em>通过</em>这门语言学习其他知识。他们在学校里花十多年时间，用目标语言吸收历史、科学、地理、文学等知识。这让他们拥有共同的知识基础，以及非母语者通常欠缺的学术语言熟悉度。"}},{"id":"segment-0003","type":"paragraph","content":{"en":"A small example: In Mexico, people learn that there are 5 continents, rather than the 7 that are taught in the US. Little things like this aren't really important for fluency, but improve cultural knowledge and awareness.","zh":"举个小例子：在墨西哥，人们学习的是世界有5大洲，而不是美国教授的7大洲。这样的细节并不真正影响流利度，却能提升文化知识和意识。"}},{"id":"segment-0004","type":"paragraph","content":{"en":"This sub-phase is about filling these gap. You're going to learn academic and cultural content in the target language — almost as if you're going through the education system of the country. This simultaneously deepens your vocabulary, exposes you to formal and academic writing styles, and gives you the cultural literacy that native speakers share.","zh":"这一子阶段旨在填补这些空白。你将用目标语言学习学术和文化内容——几乎就像在这个国家的教育体系中接受教育一样。这样既能深化词汇，也能让你接触正式和学术写作风格，并获得母语者共同拥有的文化素养。"}},{"id":"whats-new","type":"heading","level":2,"content":{"en":"What's New","zh":"有什么新内容"}},{"id":"segment-0006","type":"paragraph","content":{"en":"<strong>Academic immersion</strong> — Read textbooks, watch lectures, and study academic materials in the target language. Choose subjects that interest you or that are culturally important in the countries where the language is spoken. History, geography, and science are particularly valuable because they give you context for conversations, media, and cultural references. High school or early university level is ideal. <a href=\"/roadmap/library/domains\">Domains</a>","zh":"<strong>学术沉浸</strong>——用目标语言阅读教材、观看讲座、学习学术材料。选择你感兴趣的科目，或是在使用该语言的国家具有文化重要性的科目。历史、地理和科学尤其有价值，因为它们能为对话、媒体内容和文化引用提供背景。高中或大学初年级水平最为理想。<a href=\"/roadmap/library/domains\">领域</a>"}},{"id":"segment-0007","type":"paragraph","content":{"en":"If you live in a country that speaks your target language, you have the perfect opportunity to look for university courses that are open to the public and attend them! As well as take advantage of libraries or by buying your own copies of textbooks used in schools.","zh":"如果你生活在使用目标语言的国家，就有绝佳机会寻找对公众开放的大学课程并参加！你还可以利用图书馆，或购买学校使用的教材。"}},{"id":"segment-0008","type":"paragraph","content":{"en":"<strong>Note-taking in the target language</strong> — Take notes on what you're learning, in the target language. This is a form of assisted writing that forces you to process and reformulate complex ideas. It builds academic vocabulary and trains your ability to express precise, technical thoughts. Bonus points if you look up note taking tutorials <em>in</em> your target language!","zh":"<strong>用目标语言记笔记</strong>——用目标语言记录你正在学习的内容。这是一种辅助写作形式，会迫使你处理并重新组织复杂思想。它能积累学术词汇，并训练你表达精确、技术性观点的能力。如果你还用<em>目标语言</em>查找记笔记教程，就更好了！"}},{"id":"segment-0009","type":"paragraph","content":{"en":"<strong>Essay writing</strong> — Write longer, more structured pieces about what you're studying. This pushes your writing to a higher level of formality and precision than everyday communication requires. <a href=\"/roadmap/library/assisted-writing\">Assisted Writing</a>","zh":"<strong>写论文</strong>——围绕所学内容写更长、更有结构的文章。这会将你的写作推向比日常交流所需更正式、更精确的水平。<a href=\"/roadmap/library/assisted-writing\">辅助写作</a>"}},{"id":"segment-0010","type":"paragraph","content":{"en":"<strong>Grammar Study (academic)</strong> — At this level, grammar study focuses on the formal and literary patterns used in academic writing — things like complex subordinate clauses, passive constructions, and register-specific conventions that don't come up much in casual speech. <a href=\"/roadmap/library/grammar-study\">Grammar Study</a>","zh":"<strong>语法学习（学术）</strong>——在这一水平，语法学习侧重于学术写作中使用的正式和文学性结构，例如复杂的从句、被动结构，以及日常口语中不常出现的特定语域规范。<a href=\"/roadmap/library/grammar-study\">语法学习</a>"}},{"id":"your-routine","type":"heading","level":2,"content":{"en":"Your Routine","zh":"你的日常安排"}},{"id":"segment-0012","type":"paragraph","content":{"en":"Priming is higher than usual as you're actively studying content:","zh":"由于你在主动学习内容，预热时间会比平时更长："}},{"id":"segment-0013","type":"list","ordered":false,"items":[{"en":"<strong>Priming:</strong> 30%","zh":"<strong>预热：</strong>30%"},{"en":"<strong>Interactive Immersion:</strong> 40%","zh":"<strong>互动式沉浸：</strong>40%"},{"en":"<strong>Freeflow Immersion:</strong> 15%","zh":"<strong>自由流式沉浸：</strong>15%"},{"en":"<strong>Output:</strong> 15%","zh":"<strong>输出：</strong>15%"}]},{"id":"sample-daily-schedule","type":"heading","level":3,"content":{"en":"Sample Daily Schedule","zh":"每日安排示例"}},{"id":"segment-0015","type":"list","ordered":false,"items":[{"en":"Vocab study: 15 mins","zh":"词汇学习：15分钟"},{"en":"Grammar study: 15 mins","zh":"语法学习：15分钟"},{"en":"Active immersion in school materials (textbooks, lectures): 40 mins","zh":"主动沉浸于学校教材（教科书、讲座）：40分钟"},{"en":"Freeflow listening/notes review: 15 mins","zh":"自由流式听力/笔记复习：15分钟"},{"en":"Assisted writing (notes and essays): 15 mins","zh":"辅助写作（笔记和论文）：15分钟"}]},{"id":"when-to-move-on","type":"heading","level":2,"content":{"en":"When to Move On","zh":"何时进入下一阶段"}},{"id":"segment-0017","type":"paragraph","content":{"en":"Move to 7C when you:","zh":"当你满足以下条件时，进入7C："}},{"id":"segment-0018","type":"list","ordered":false,"items":[{"en":"Know 10,000+ words","zh":"掌握10000个以上词汇"},{"en":"Can understand entry-level college texts and lectures on at least 2 chosen topics","zh":"能够理解至少两个所选主题的大学入门级教材和讲座"},{"en":"Can write an essay on one of those topics without major errors or unclear arguments","zh":"能够围绕其中一个主题写论文，没有重大错误或含糊不清的论点"}]}],"cards":[]},"siteBasePath":"/my_learning_docs"}]
